\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Learning-rate sensitivity of convolutional DFA on Fashion-MNIST (single seed, GPU). Short-budget sweep (4 epochs) plus an extended run at the stable setting (8 epochs). Test accuracy oscillates epoch-to-epoch even at the stable learning rate, while train accuracy climbs monotonically; the headline result in Table~\ref {tab:cnn-gap} (63.7\%) remains our best final-epoch DFA accuracy.}}{13}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dfa-lr-sweep}{{7}{13}{Learning-rate sensitivity of convolutional DFA on Fashion-MNIST (single seed, GPU). Short-budget sweep (4 epochs) plus an extended run at the stable setting (8 epochs). Test accuracy oscillates epoch-to-epoch even at the stable learning rate, while train accuracy climbs monotonically; the headline result in Table~\ref {tab:cnn-gap} (63.7\%) remains our best final-epoch DFA accuracy}{table.caption.19}{}}
